{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:38 2026-11-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:38 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:38 2026-11-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2deeb96b603aca38d09b789715170be4/2026-11/888_20.jpg\"/><p>今（21日）午3時15分，一輛私家車沿北角福蔭道行駛，轉入宏安道，撞到一名老婦，她倒臥地上，腳部被右前輪壓住，途人大驚報警，消防接報到場將她救起，由救護車送院治理。</p><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce2584552048e222627015f597531d56/2026-11/01_2_17.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c5dac86d465fbd0a79e385a2a2a9c91/2026-11/02_2_18.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9d734a4b7a5bf392e3fec7456bbed51/2026-11/03_5_13.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddbe4e622ea9a584ae8cdbf20e6cfd3f/2026-11/04_3_23.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/702cee82b9a4e31ab280072274636727/2026-11/05_2_9.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82bca769c53f5705087a4807cc636480/2026-11/11_0_17.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e37c8b8fdcb8d9b7b246145622fe875a/2026-11/12_4_19.jpg\"/><p>現場遺下血漬，肇事司機在場協助調查。網上圖片顯示，女事主面朝地伏在地上，多名熱心途人施援，到場消防員蹲下查看車輪壓住腳部情況。</p><img alt=\"肇事司機在警車接受調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fc6cf3f110aaa8cb60ace95dfe6d000/2026-11/01_1_36.jpg\"/><img alt=\"車輪底的血漬。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82668bdb3f3c510abeba7cba73992aed/2026-11/02_43.jpg\"/><img alt=\"地上遺下血漬。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a95fda370cf9e3061214f037b87a6b5a/2026-11/03_1_34.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查意外原因。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15d50205f7eeabb24fd1ef2931d27e99/2026-11/04_3_24.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查意外原因。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7819b86fe6707630d8257200bd9be73/2026-11/05_1_22.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.113619+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:38:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:25.936487+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:26.756642+00:00","content_hash":"35406eda27e79b2165df4dc0abadbd482da60fa00dbb481f7efb8a522c9b42ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}